accept_75501_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am a disciple of Yunyan Pavilion, under the orders of the Lord of the Pavilion, specially inviting</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >to come to Yunyan Pavilion for a gathering. I wonder if</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >have any thoughts?</font>
accept_75513_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Woof woof woof</font>
accept_75522_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >On this journey, I also</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >know</font> <font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >of the injustice you have suffered. Now, the matter of you being wanted by the court is rarely mentioned. However, the warrant is still in effect, so it is best for you to act low-key when returning to the Central Plains.</font>
accept_75523_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >My friend, you seem quite serious. Did something happen on the way? </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >happened?</font>
accept_75526_1=(Staring at you with sharp eyes) Are you a disciple of the Dongfang Family?
accept_75530_1=You are injured, but fortunately they are just minor injuries.
accept_75535_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Recently, there has been a trend in the martial arts world to pursue the study of mysterious techniques. This is not advisable, as these techniques often take shortcuts and forcefully absorb energy, which can lead to dangerous consequences. I will now pass on to you the first part of our secret internal skill, "Knowing Skill." Please accept it.</font>
