complete_75504=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So, does this mean that the secret teachings are in trouble? Who are these people exactly?</font>
complete_75505=People in the martial arts world have always been reserved towards the imperial court. How can we subtly involve them in our plans?
complete_75513=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I know of two martial artists, try to get it from them. One is named Wen Jiang and the other is named</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hu Guan.</font>
complete_75514=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I lost... Since it was Brother Zhang who sent you, you can take the fragments with you.</font>
complete_75515=
complete_75521=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are right. Nowadays, Japanese has already joined forces with foreign tantric Buddhism and has even colluded with the northern Xiongnu people. They are only waiting to destroy the dragon veins of the Great Ming and attack with their army. I have already discussed with my predecessors and selected a group of courageous martial arts heroes to establish the Tian Dao Alliance. Together with the Qin King, we will resist the foreign enemies and prevent the destruction of the dragon veins of the Great Ming, in order to protect the country.</font>
complete_75524=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The armory is a military stronghold and is always heavily guarded. Now that the armory has been bombed, the court will definitely hold someone responsible. The Han King is currently inspecting Yanjing and is resting in the Yan Palace. The Han King recently invited me for a meeting, but now that a major incident has occurred, I am unable to attend... Please go to the Yan Palace and meet with the Han King on my behalf, and ask him to plead for the Dongfang family in front of the emperor.</font>
complete_75531=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Finally, my wish has been fulfilled. Thank you for helping me bring back my ancestors' remains to the grasslands.</font>
complete_75534=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If you are willing, you can stay by my side and be my advisor. I believe that with my protection, even if you are unable to uncover the truth after a year, I will ensure your safety.</font>
complete_75535=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The ultimate goal of the Knowing Skill is to enter the state of forgetting oneself and the world, achieving ultimate stillness. With long-term practice, internal energy will increase rapidly, greatly improving one's agility.</font>
