context_75501=At the invitation of the Yunyan Pavilion Master, I am preparing to go to the Yunyan Pavilion for a meeting.
context_75502=Visit the Qin Palace to pay my respects to the Qin King.
context_75503=The representative of the Esoteric Sect is suspicious. Inquire Qin King.
context_75504=Explore the strange and mysterious as a holy envoy of the secret teachings.
context_75505=Probe the Qin Emperor to uncover his true intentions.
context_75506=After a long absence, go and catch up with the leader.
context_75507=The leader seems to have urgent matters to discuss, so hurry to Suzhou to find the leader of the Lin alliance.
context_75508=The leader personally welcomes you, so go and ask for their advice.
context_75509=The leader asks you to go and find his fourth disciple, Xie Ruoning, to gather some clues.
context_75510=Feeling played by Xie Ruoning, go and ask her for an explanation.
context_75511=Ask Xie Ruoning's followers for information and go search for clues.
context_75512=As rumors spread and villagers panic, they come to you for help.
context_75513=Take your hunting dog and search the village for any discoveries.
context_75514=Find a way to obtain other chess piece fragments.
context_75515=Put together the collected fragments and solve the puzzle with Zhang Danxu.
context_75516=Since the situation has become somewhat clear, leave the Cloud Cliff Pavilion first.
context_75517=Meet with the King of Qin and understand his true intentions.
context_75518=After meeting with the King of Qin, you felt that this matter was quite suspicious, so you hurried back to the Cloud Cliff Pavilion.
context_75519=Found a well and jumped in to see if there were any secrets inside.
context_75520=Quickly leave this place and return to Suzhou to inform the leader of the martial arts alliance, Lin Tiannan.
context_75521=Inform the leader of the discovery around the Murong family.
context_75522=Pay a visit to Lin Tiannan to inquire about the matter of the martial arts sects being suppressed by the court.
context_75523=Report to the leader about the incident of rescuing Lei Yu on the way and ask for their opinion.
context_75524=There was an explosion at the weapons depot of the Dongfang family, so I went to the scene to investigate.
context_75525=Go to the Yan Palace to meet the King of Han and inform him about the explosion at the Dongfang family's weapons depot.
context_75526=Report to the Han King that there have been sightings of giant rats in the city of Yanjing. Investigate any clues related to the giant rats as ordered.
context_75527=The giant rat exploded, revealing an assassin inside. Investigate the origin of the assassin.
context_75528=The guard at the Ducha Warehouse was killed, and the clues were cut off. The only option is to go to the city gate and take a look.
context_75529=Waking up in a valley, danger is everywhere. Leave this place first and continue to search for clues.
context_75530=Inquire about the identity and purpose of the black-clad person who came to the rescue.
context_75531=Learn that the black-clad person is from the Wala tribe and inquire about their true intentions.
context_75532=Go deep into the cave to investigate and discover a box containing gunpowder.
context_75533=Uncover the plot of the Kuyi people to destroy Yanjing and do everything possible to stop it.
context_75534=Dismantle the gunpowder in the mine and prevent the last mine from exploding. Go to meet the Han King.
context_75535=Go to the abbot to receive a reward.
context_75536=Go to the head of the sect to receive a reward.
context_75537=Go to the head of the sect to receive a reward.
context_75538=Go to the head of the sect to receive a reward.
context_75539=Go to the head of the sect to receive a reward.
