menu_75501_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since it is an invitation from the Yunyan Pavilion's leader, I naturally have to go.</font>
menu_75513_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Juhua is obedient.</font>
menu_75522_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, leader, for your recognition. I will remember it in my heart.</font>
menu_75523_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The leader has a keen eye and just now, I encountered Miss Lei Yu from the Thunderbolt Hall on the way. She was being chased and blocked by soldiers.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I saw that there were many soldiers and they were bullying a weak woman, so I couldn't help but intervene.</font>
menu_75526_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I pay my respects to the prince. I beg your pardon, but I am not a member of the Dongfang Family. I have been entrusted by the master of the manor to report an important matter. Yesterday, Dongfang Family's armory was destroyed by gunpowder.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >(Luckily, the prince did not recognize me. As a wanted fugitive, the prince did not suspect anything.)</font>
menu_75530_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0c31" >(Alert)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >for your chivalrous act just now.</font>
menu_75535_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Master. Your teachings will be remembered by me.</font>
menu_75536_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Master. Your teachings are deeply ingrained in my heart.</font>
menu_75537_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Master. Your teachings are deeply ingrained in my heart.</font>
