menu_75543_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, Grandmaster</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Grandmaster</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >'s teachings are deeply ingrained in my heart.</font>
