menu_75545_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Master. Your teachings are deeply ingrained in my heart.</font>
submit_75504=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't worry, Your Highness. I have already sent skilled experts from Tianwai Tian to track them down. I believe the truth will be revealed soon.</font>
submit_75505=<font face="Default" color="#ff001d" >(Glances at the unfinished game of chess beside, smiling without saying a word)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
submit_75513=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > I'm on it. </font>
submit_75514=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother Hu</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
submit_75521=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As descendants of China, it is our duty to protect our country. I am willing to join the Tian Dao League to guard the dragon veins of Ming.</font>
submit_75524=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have heard that the Han King is highly regarded by the emperor. If the Han King is willing to intervene, perhaps this matter can be resolved. It is urgent, I will go there quickly.</font>
submit_75531=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >No need to be polite, if it weren't for Your Highness's help, I would have perished.</font>
submit_75534=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Han King</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >for your kindness. However, I must personally find the culprit and clear my name before parting ways with the prince.</font>
submit_75535=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will study diligently and practice diligently.</font>
submit_75536=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will study diligently and practice diligently.</font>
